  "question": {
    "text": "For an initial screening of an admission test, a candidate is given fifty problems to solve. If the probability that the candidate can solve any problem is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math> then the probability that he is unable to solve less than two problems is",
